    "start": 286.351,
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5191,
    "char_start": 5126,
    "end": 292.556,
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02",
    "start": 288.602,
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5296,
    "char_start": 5192,
    "end": 298.137,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01",
    "start": 292.556,
    "text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5350,
    "char_start": 5297,
    "end": 300.981,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02",
    "start": 298.137,
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5420,
    "char_start": 5351,
    "end": 304.683,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s03",
    "start": 300.981,
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5451,
    "char_start": 5421,
    "end": 306.312,
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01",
    "start": 304.683,
    "text": "Where is it no longer working?",
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5589,
    "char_start": 5452,
    "end": 314.296,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 306.312,
    "text": "And when teams adopt Shimano equipment, this compromise becomes apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5633,
    "char_start": 5590,
    "end": 316.545,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 314.296,
    "text": "What heuristic do you consistently rely on?",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5707,
    "char_start": 5634,
    "end": 320.363,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s02",
    "start": 316.545,
    "text": "Where do the fields of interviewing and transmission mechanics intersect?",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5794,
    "char_start": 5708,
    "end": 325.561,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 320.363,
    "text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5863,
    "char_start": 5795,
    "end": 329.671,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s02",
    "start": 325.561,
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5935,
    "char_start": 5864,
    "end": 334.402,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 329.671,
    "text": "Before we conclude, what is one thing that listeners can try this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6004,
    "char_start": 5936,
    "end": 338.284,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 334.402,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6040,
    "char_start": 6005,
    "end": 340.282,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 338.284,
    "text": "Everything else is about iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6102,
    "char_start": 6041,
    "end": 344.072,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 340.282,
    "text": "Before we conclude, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6187,
    "char_start": 6103,
    "end": 349.292,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 344.072,
    "text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – built with the keyboard in mind.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6236,
    "char_start": 6188,
    "end": 352.165,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s03",
    "start": 349.292,
    "text": "Mathieu Lefèvre, thank you for the conversation.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
